corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6454557-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987211007,"bound_title":"Candide, of Het optimisme","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789029554343","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p03620532X","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-012","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6454557-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":987311002}},{"relation":"works","id":987111001,"after":{"id":987111001,"title":"The Trial","cover_id":null,"author_id":987310001,"work_type":null,"source_type":"open_library","open_library_id":"OL498463W","first_publish_year":1925,"native_identity_key":"nlscale:fixture012:177"}},{"relation":"editions","id":987211008,"work_id":987111001,"language":"dut","after":{"id":987211008,"title":"Het proces","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789021469911","work_id":987111001,"cover_id":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Querido","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL24632641M"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","work_id":987111001,"language":"nl","after":{"text":"Een man wordt gearresteerd zonder te horen waarvan hij precies wordt beschuldigd. Terwijl hij probeert zich te verdedigen, blijkt het juridische systeem om hem heen ondoorzichtig en moeilijk te bereiken. Iedere poging duidelijkheid te krijgen leidt naar nieuwe onzekerheid. De roman volgt hoe zijn verhouding tot het proces geleidelijk verandert en hoe het steeds meer ruimte in zijn leven inneemt. Kafka beschrijft een wereld waarin formele procedures overal aanwezig zijn, terwijl hun betekenis buiten bereik blijft.","work_id":987111001,"evidence":[{"note":"Kafka’s Der Prozess novel, exact Dutch hardcover. Do not infer original publication from the later KB cited1935printing; no year change proposed. DNB-held bibliogra